# Android / device operations

Detail: `docs/ACCELERATED_TEST_MODE.md`. Safety: `10-safety-production`.

## May automate when an EXECUTION plan already authorizes it

- ADB read-only inspection (`dumpsys`, `pm path`, logcat collect, etc.)
- Launch approved TEST/accelerated app; HOME; waits; screenshots/evidence
- Explicitly approved build/test commands (prefer accelerated device tests)

## Never automate

- Telegram UI
- OEM Auto Start / battery / autostart settings UI
- SAF / DocumentsUI selection when unsafe or unreliable
- Risky production settings changes

Request user interaction only when unavoidable.

## Device unavailable / lock (exact text)

If the device is locked or wireless debugging dropped:

```text
Разблокируй телефон и введи PIN. Если беспроводная отладка отключилась — включи её. Затем напиши “готово”.
```

After a planned `adb reboot`:

```text
Разблокируй телефон и введи PIN, затем напиши “готово”
```

## Do not embed volatile device facts

No current `boot_count`, PID, alarm inventory, or one-off OEM state in rules — put those in task reports / `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md` when needed.
